## What's intentionally NOT included here

Two pieces depend entirely on your specific project code/config, so they can't be generic copy-paste commands:

- **Coturn configuration** (`/etc/turnserver.conf`) — needs your actual TURN realm, external IP, and credentials.
- **Mediasoup worker/router config and the radio (RTMP/HLS) service setup** — these live inside your application code, not the OS.

If you share your `turnserver.conf` requirements or your Mediasoup/radio service entry points, I can write those configs out fully in the same step-by-step style.